  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|308": "\"Don't think you're the only one\n  who traveled back in time...",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|37c": "\"...Guh!",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|390": "\"Ugh... urgh...",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|3b8": "\"...!",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|3d8": "\"Father... Father!\n  Please, open your eyes...!",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|464": "\"Ugh... Jade?\n  Can it be... Jade?",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|4d0": "\"It seems I've had a very long dream...\n  Since the monsters attacked Dundrasil,\n  what have I done...?",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|5b8": "\"Oh...! That is the Luminary's mark...",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|624": "\"The baby from that day\n  has grown so strong...!",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|6b0": "\"I want to speak to you properly,\n  but my body won't obey me yet...",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|744": "\"*cough* *cough*...!",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|770": "\"Father...!\n  Please don't talk too much.\n  Let's rest your body first.",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|804": "\"I'll look after Father's condition.\n  {var:1}, come to this throne room\n  again tomorrow.",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|8dc": "\"Jade finally met her papa after sixteen\n  years... Let's leave\n  the two of them alone.",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|960": "News that the Heliodor king had been\npossessed by a monster spread through\nthe castle at once.",
  "/param/scenario/cs/c_010_cs_090.pack|cs_text.bxon|9f4": "The real king was tended to right away...\n{var:1} and friends would rest the night,\nwaiting for his awakening.",
